  <para style="h">2 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka đu bơơr</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Th</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Phaau-lô, lơq Siin-ven nek palơq Ti-mô-thê, pagơơi đóng Akóón Dhơn Chuôq Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka kalóóng Yaang Pleng, nek Ama lơq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Nhan ơơn phươk liêm lơq yươq rauha tư tââq Yaang Pleng, nek Ama, lơq Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih, tơơt dhiq adhi anó.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Adhi anó ơơi, nôôq yi phaai taluôn ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng leq adhi anó, kơi ađek nek rau dhalam pâng, taai lóóm huuiq adhi anó ting tangêi n'dhương karơ, lơq lóóm tanhơr ưng ting chanak manưih kalóóng tabhơt adhi anó nek palơq xóng ađêi bhiêk yuur tatrul; <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />taai ađek, nôôq yi pajơơr ađêi dhiq adhi anó kalóóng m'pơng nôôq akóón dhơn ưng Yaang Pleng leq rau mưng lóóm ưng adhi anó lơq lóóm huuiq m'pơng dyóp rau galuh jarnah xarngaat ưng adhi anó, nek palơq nôôq bhrê hư hơq adhi anó dyơq phaai jruôn, <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />ađek nek pan-nal leq rau xêi xanêi bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, pakoom đóng adhi anó buôn bâân đóók nek đu đaang palơq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng, taai katiêk ađek hơq adhi anó kung dyơq đơơp jarnah; <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />taai alua nek bhơt liêm xók Yaang Pleng chróót rau bhrê hư dhiq nôôq đu tavaaih bhrê hư leq adhi anó, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />lơq đóng leq adhi anó, nek nôôq manưih đơơp bhrê hư, rau dhêi drơq palơq nôôq yi xók rau bhral tơk ưng Chuôq Jê-su gluh pakah tââq pleng palơq nôôq dhơn pleng gamak karơ ưng Ađó. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Kalóóng par-aang óih rahôôq, đââng rau têêng janah tơk đóng nôôq đu kah lêi n'nal Yaang Pleng lơq đóng nôôq đu kah xâng huuiq Taruuih Liêm ưng Chuôq nôôq he nek Chuôq Jê-su, <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Piđó nek nôôq đu e pei geng janah nek rau chêt bil nh'chró, changaai tââq mat Chuôq lơq tââq cha-iil tabah ưng mataai raman Ađó. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Xók Ađó tơk buôn bâân bhi haanh tââq nôôq manưih huuiq ưng Ađó lơq bâân ngel móng m'pơng dyóp ngaai ơi patơơt lóóm huuiq, tââq paraaq truuih ưng nôôq yi tơk palơq adhi anó kalóóng tangêi ađek ơi bâân đơơp huuiq. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ơi taai ađek, nôôq yi bhiêk taluôn gavơh nhan đóng adhi anó buôn Yaang Pleng nôôq he đóók adhi anó nek ađaang palơq rau dhaloong, lơq buôn Ađó têêng paxong dyóp rau rââm kiêng leq rau liêm lơq tarnêêng ưng lóóm huuiq tââq raman mataai, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />hơq đóng dhanóók ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su, bâân bhi haanh dhiq adhi anó lơq adhi anó bâân cha-iil tabah tââq Ađó, ting ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng lơq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Adhi anó ơơi, dyơq leq rau bhral ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih, lơq rau tarlum karong ưng nôôq he palơq Ađó, nôôq yi nhan adhi anó <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />kơi adhi anó óóq dhê dhaai bâân grơ ngơơt môôiq kadrêq kadrơn kalóóng lóóm karnóq ađêi, kung óóq tââq mưi yaang, môôiq tââq mưi taruuih, môôiq tââq mưi tala thơ đơơp ngóq tơk tââq nôôq yi, xók praaq kơi tangêi ưng Chuôq ơi abhral aq. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Nhan yươq manak manâ ting dhơ n'đó kơi ve chóóm galơơk chachââr adhi anó, Ơi la kah rau têêng tamôôp taruuih bhral laloom, lơq akóón manưih ưng rau kah ve gani bâân tapakah, hơq nek panong akóón ưng rau leng kaxiêt, <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />nek đu jaklâk jơl lơq tư yuur padyók ađêi tarjơl jaklâk palơq dyóp rau bâân đóók nek yaang môôiq nek rau đu bhuôih haanh. Tơk mơ, tư ađó tơơt kalóóng đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng, pakah kơi chênh ađêi nek Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Adhi anó kah hei kơi, xók dyơq tơơt palơq adhi anó, aku biêh ơi đóng adhi anó n'nal nôôq tarnêêng ađô ng'kơi? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Lơq xók ađôk adhi anó ơi n'nal hau rau dyơq takajơq, buôn ađó chapiên bâân tabhral mót dhalam ganah ưng ađó. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ơi rau đu lalââp ưng rau kah ve gani ơi xók vôôiq veq, Yaang mưi giêl dyơq đương kajơq ađó xók ađôk bhiêk dyơq đóng tơk bhêêl Yaang achêk gluh lơh dham đương kajơq dhalam m'pơng, <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />lơq hayơq đu kah ve gani e bâân tapakah, nek đu hơq Chuôq Jê-su e leng kaxiêt palơq parhââm ưng bóóp Ađó, lơq e têêng ađó val xar hư bil tââq cha-iil tabah rau bhral tơk ưng Ađó, <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />hơq rau tabhral ưng đu kah ve gani tôôh nek đươi leq tarnêêng têêng ưng Sa-taan palơq tabhơt mataai karơ palơq kanal chrih, kung kơi gun raman galơơk chachââr, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />lơq palơq dyóp kơi galơơk chachââr lơt môôp pakoom đóng nôôq đu chêt bil, hơq piđó chêt bil nek taai piđó ơi kah pơh đơơp lóóm tanhơr paraaq dhalam đóng ađêi buôn bâân paq. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Lơq ơi taai ađek, Yaang Pleng pajaau piđó leq ting pâng ưng rau lơt xraang buôn piđó huuiq rau galơơk chachââr, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />buôn đóng tabhơt piđó e bâân xêi matu, hơq nek nôôq đu kah huuiq paraaq dhalam, hơq vil bhuui kiêng rau môôp lơt.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Bơơi, adhi anó ơơi, nek nôôq manưih bâân Chuôq nh'nhơr, nôôq yi phaai taluôn ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng leq adhi anó. Taai Yaang Pleng ơi chââih adhi anó kơi nôôq pale tââp bóóng buôn đơơp ơơn paq jóói đươi rau pasek paliêm ưng Yaang Liêm lơq lóóm huuiq dhiq paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Taai buôn đơơp ơơn achêk, Ađó ơi dhaloong adhi anó dhiq Taruuih Liêm ưng nôôq yi, tơk palơq rau đơơp đươi cha-iil tabah ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Taai kơi achêk, adhi anó ơơi, phaai dyương tamưng lơq jư panhơm nôôq taruuih kaxu đu adhi anó ơi bâân pató pachóóm, dhơ dhakơi palơq bóóp paraaq môôiq palơq thơ ưng nôôq yi.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Nhan chênh Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih, lơq Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, Yaang nh'nhơr nôôq he lơq ơi đóng leq nôôq he rau tabhơơl pahêêl tơk nh'chró nek palơq rau lóóm rââm liêm kre tââq ơơn phươk liêm, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />nhan Ađó bhơơl pahêêl lơq têêng đóng mưng karơ tââq lóóm adhi anó kalóóng dyóp rau têêng vôôiq palơq bóóp paraaq liêm kre.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Tatun xariêq, adhi anó ơơi, nhan gavơh nhan đóng nôôq yi, buôn paraaq ưng Chuôq m'bhraach đâh trââi klaaq lơq bâân bhi haanh, kung kơi ơi bâân lêi dhiq adhi anó, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />lơq buôn nôôq yi bâân paq jóói tââq nôôq đu pađươk lơq lơt aak, ơi eh rau dyóp ngaai maar ve lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Bơơi Chuôq, Yaang e têêng đóng tamưng karơ lơq jư lêi adhi anó lơh tââq đu aak, Ađó nek yươq tadhơ lóóm. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Nôôq yi huuiq mưng dhiq Chuôq leq adhi anó kơi adhi anó dyơq têêng lơq e têêng rau dhơơm nôôq yi truuih pachóóm. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Rââm nhan Chuôq kađââng lóóm adhi anó malóóm leq tanhơr ưng Yaang Pleng lơq tơk palơq rau jruôn parngau ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek, adhi anó ơơi, vơn dhanóók Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih, nôôq yi truuih kayua adhi anó, buôn adhi anó róóch changaai dyóp ngaai đu huuiq mamông kah matich lơq kah ting nôôq taruuih kaxu hơq adhi anó ơi đơơp tââq nôôq yi. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ơi chênh adhi anó n'nal kơng phaai ting đuui xamil nôôq yi n'đó kơi, taai nôôq yi ơi yươq mamông kah matich m'pơng adhi anó, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />nôôq yi kung kah cha kagóh chana padyơk tââq mưi ngaai ngâ, bơơi hayum tangêi têêng tarnêêng kalóóng nhưh nhok lơq gleh gleeng buôn óóq têêng ganưi haleng đóng leq dhơ dhangaai kalóóng adhi anó, <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />eh rau taai nôôq yi kah ve chóóm, hơq buôn nôôq yi tư patơơt ađêi kơi m'beq xamil leq adhi anó buôn ting đuui nôôq yi. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ơi patơk mơ xók nôôq yi dyơq tơơt palơq adhi anó, nôôq yi biêh ơi truuih móón adhi anó rau ađô, kơi ađô: “La ngaai manưih kah kiêng têêng tarnêêng nek manưih ađek kung óóq chacha.” <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ơi nôôq yi xâng móón dhiq m'pơng adhi anó ve masôôq manưih mamông kah matich, kah têêng tarnêêng hơq đóók kachrua leq chiên eh rau ưng ađêi. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Bơơi, kalóóng Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih, nôôq yi truuih móón lơq panhel bhơơl nôôq manưih kơi achêk, hơq đóng piđó ve chóóm cha chana padyơk ưng ađêi xók têêng tarnêêng nek palơq parngau bha-ip. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Hayơq adhi anó, adhi anó óóq bôôk nhưh xók têêng rau dhalam. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Kơi lââng, la ngaai manưih kah huuiq jư paraaq nôôq yi dhiq thơ ađô, nek phaai chamet lêi manưih achêk — buôn kah tơơt praaq palơq ađó, hơq đóng manưih ađek tư lêi kachiit mat. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Óóq lêi manưih achêk kơi brau, hơq phaai praaq pachóóm kơi mưi chanak adhi anó.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Gavơh nhan chênh Chuôq yươq rauha đóng leq adhi anó yươq rauha dhiq dyóp rau tarnêêng kalóóng dyóp rau. Nhan Chuôq tơơt palơq tabhơt adhi anó. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Paraaq tamóh tham ađô tââq chênh têi aku — Phaau-lô, ađek nek chư kanal kalóóng dyóp tala thơ. Aku đóók xaraq kơi achêk. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih tơơt palơq tabhơt adhi anó.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>